name: Input and cancellation remain usable during a live repository inventory wait
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare
env: PATH=@ART/tool-bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/bin:/bin
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false,"sampleLimit":200}
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 30 context:build indexed 16000 files | baseline
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART arm
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false,"sampleLimit":200}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART live-120
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART probe-p120
live-snap: typing-120x36
keys: C-u
resize: 160x48
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART live-160
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART probe-p160
live-snap: typing-160x48
keys: C-u
resize: 96x89
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART live-96
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART probe-p096
live-snap: typing-96x89
keys: C-u
resize: 80x24
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART live-80
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART probe-p080
live-snap: typing-80x24
keys: C-u
resize: 60x20
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART live-60
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART probe-p060
live-snap: typing-60x20
keys: C-u
resize: 40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART live-40
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART probe-p040
live-snap: typing-40x12
keys: C-c
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART canceled
require-live-snap: 15 kz> p040 | canceled-draft
ask: Is the prompt responsive across the viewport matrix while a confirmed Git child is live, and does cancellation retain the draft and shell?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART release
keys: C-u
resize: 120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART arm
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false,"sampleLimit":200}
type: rebuild-draft
require-live-snap: 30 rebuild-draft | rebuilding-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART release-after-wait
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART rebuilt
require-live-snap: 15 kz> rebuild-draft | completed-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completion
expect: rebuild-draft
ask: Does completion preserve the typed draft without stealing focus, while the explicit rebuild remains separate from the canceled receipt?
keys: C-u
paste-file: @ART/canceled-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · canceled | canceled-receipt
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/canceled-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · canceled | recovered-cancellation
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain the canceled receipt, completed rebuild and unchanged source without repeat work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
